6502 ROM File System (filesys.asm)
----------------------------------
Some REU filesystem routines in `src/kernel/reu-fs.inc` are adapted
from Lee Davison's simple ROM filesystem for 6502
(`reference/filesys.asm`) — notably the file/directory search
algorithm (`LAB_find`), the directory entry format, and the flags
convention, ported from C64-memory access to REU DMA.

